# Battle against Miraidon (the Paradox Pokémon of the far future): the paradox pair's call (a leap up and a turn
# back to the tonic) traced on a square lead over a sequenced pulse and a sixteenth synth bass in D minor.
# Original composition for this game.
title Battle! Miraidon
tempo 180
meter 4/4
lowhptempo 1.07
reverb 0.22

track lead square lowhp=sawlead vol=0.82 pan=0 rev=0.2
  r1 | o5 d4 a8 o6 c8 d4 r4 |
  L o5 d4 a8 o6 c8 d4. f8 | o6 e4 c4 d2 | o6 d4. c8 o5 f4 b-4 | o5 a4. g8 e4 c+4 |
